(Code 1976, § 16-22)

706:
The city clerk shall issue the permit required by this article for whenever he shall find the following facts to exist:
(1) All of the statements made in the application are true;
(2) The applicant has a good character and reputation for honesty and integrity, or if the applicant is not an individual, every person responsible for such organization is of good character and has a reputation for honesty and integrity;
